[gd_resource type="Animation" format=3]

; The balloons' float away (CHANGE-BRIEF.md, revision of 21 Nov 2026, "the balloon task is 'Let
; the balloons go'"; not graded): the bunch, its knot tugged loose, rises 8.0 m over 5.0 s (120
; frames at 24 fps), swaying and turning slowly as it goes, then it's gone. Step 1/24 s,
; LOOP_NONE. On the bunch's Lift node (the three balloons and the knot): position and rotation,
; cubic; visible, discrete: shown, then hidden on the clip's last frame. Played once, only by
; scripts/camp_balloons.gd, on the bunch's own AnimationPlayer. The game counts the 5.0 s itself
; (camp_balloons.gd FLOAT_TIME), never from this clip.
; The paths are relative to the AnimationPlayer's root_node (the Bunch, in
; props/balloon_bunch.tscn).

